program	errors/deinit_suspend.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	cannot suspend in `deinit` context: `deinit` of `Resource` calls __saw_test_suspend (`Resource.deinit` suspends at line 13)
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: cannot suspend in `deinit` context: `deinit` of `Resource` calls __saw_test_suspend (`Resource.deinit` suspends at line 13)"
log	"  --> examples/errors/deinit_suspend.saw:12:5"
log	"     |"
log	" 12 |     func deinit(&var self) {"
log	"     |     ^"
log	"   hint: a `sync` context must be transitively suspension-free: remove the suspending call or hoist it out of the sync region"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
